# Find and replace a text in all shortcut of the interpreter by a new text
# short  cut alias♦text to replace with ♦ Hint information for debugging

forward♦♦W Move character forward
left♦♦A Translate to left side
back♦♦s Move backward
right♦♦D  Translate to the right side
turn_left♦♦ Arrow Left to turn on the left side
turn_right♦♦ Arrow right to turn on the right side
map♦♦M to toggle the map UI
skills♦♦K To toggle the Skill UI with the list of power
character♦♦C To toggle the character sheet with all the stats
inventory♦♦B To toggle display the inventory and money count in your bag
clan♦♦G To toggle display the clan information if you a have one
pvp♦♦V  To toggle your player versus player information
party♦♦ P  To toggle  display the party in the server to join
social♦♦I  To toggle Your friend information 
target_next_enemy♦♦ Tab to target the next enemy in the list
target_next_friendly♦♦ X the next friendly target
untarget♦♦Escape to untarget an friendly or enemy
skillbar1♦♦1 To trigger the power 1
skillbar2♦♦2 To trigger the power 2
skillbar3♦♦3 To trigger the power 3
skillbar4♦♦4 To trigger the power 4
skillbar5♦♦5 To trigger the power 5
skillbar6♦♦6 To trigger the power 6
skillbar7♦♦7 To trigger the power 7
skillbar8♦♦8 To trigger the power 8
skillbar9♦♦9 To trigger the power 9
skillbar10♦♦0 To trigger the power 10
skillbar11♦♦None To trigger the power 11 
skillbar12♦♦None To trigger the power 12
skillbar13♦♦None To trigger the power 13
skillbar14♦♦None To trigger the power 14
skillbar15♦♦None To trigger the power 15
skillbar16♦♦None To trigger the power 16
